{"id": "69360", "title": "狼少，请上钩", "author": "冲霄一鹤", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 27, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69360.htm", "intro": "七年前她放弃他如此轻易，七年后想赢回他竟难如登天，\r\n七年前他视她如生命， 七年后他恨不得要她的命，\r\n七年前她毁掉了他的善良，七年后他舍不得对她的残忍，\r\n冷酷强势的男人遇到睿智冷静的女人……火力碰撞，炸的你里焦外嫩！\r\n她步步紧逼，处处撒网；他冷眼旁观，将计就计！\r\n你扑倒，我强上，他敢强娶，她就豪夺！JQ无限，狼少，你还是给我乖乖上钩吧", "base": "files/article/html/69/69360", "chapters": [{"title": "1-10", "file": "10615905.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-18", "file": "10615906.html", "available": false}, {"title": "19-27", "file": "10615907.html", "available": false}, {"title": "28-35", "file": "10615908.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-42", "file": "10615909.html", "available": false}, {"title": "43-49", "file": "10615910.html", "available": false}, {"title": "50-56", "file": "10615911.html", "available": false}, {"title": "57-64", "file": "10615912.html", "available": false}, {"title": "65-70", "file": "10615913.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-76", "file": "10615914.html", "available": false}, {"title": "77-81", "file": "10615915.html", "available": false}, {"title": "82-86", "file": "10615916.html", "available": false}, {"title": "87-93", "file": "10615917.html", "available": false}, {"title": "94-99", "file": "10615918.html", "available": false}, {"title": "100-105", "file": "10615919.html", "available": false}, {"title": "106-110", "file": "10615920.html", "available": false}, {"title": "111-115", "file": "10615921.html", "available": false}, {"title": "116-120", "file": "10615922.html", "available": false}, {"title": "121-125", "file": "10615923.html", "available": false}, {"title": "126-130", "file": "10615924.html", "available": false}, {"title": "131-135", "file": "10615925.html", "available": false}, {"title": "136-140", "file": "10615926.html", "available": false}, {"title": "141-145", "file": "10615927.html", "available": false}, {"title": "146-150", "file": "10615928.html", "available": false